# Shared VHS settings. Sourced by hero.tape and browse.tape.
# Width/Height are set in each tape BEFORE this file is sourced (VHS ignores
# most Set commands after the first non-setting command).
# No Output / Type / Require here.

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"
Set Padding 16
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Set Framerate 24
Set CursorBlink false
